[en.EVENT_EEMO_1]
The Griffon Lies Heavy - Equestria Empire Ministry of Order Report

[en.EVENT_EEMO_1_desc]
According to an EEMO investigation, a prohibited book called “The Griffon Lies Heavy” has recently begun circulating on the market. The book is a new work by A.K. Yearling, the author of the “Daring Do” series. Due to its inappropriate content, the new book was taken off the shelves shortly after its release, but there are still illegal publishers from unknown sources printing and distributing these books.
The Ministry of Order is conducting a thorough investigation and has begun secretly arresting the fugitive author A.K. Yearling. The latest evidence shows that A.K. Yearling is active near the Forbidden Zone jungle.

[en.EVENT_EEMO_1_o0]
Strict Suppression!

[en.EVENT_EEMO_1_o1]
Fascinating Intel

[en.EVENT_EEMO_2]
Daring Do’s Hat? - Equestria Empire Ministry of Order Report

[en.EVENT_EEMO_2_desc]
During the search of A.K. Yearling’s former residence, the Ministry of Order accidentally found a hat that is suspected to be Daring Do’s. Is this just cosplay? Disguise? Or does it mean that the novels written by A.K. Yearling are all true? Then, is the parallel world described in “The Griffon Lies Heavy” also real? No matter what the truth is, the investigation must be carried out in secret, and the public must NOT be informed.

[en.EVENT_EEMO_2_o0]
Strict Suppression!

[en.EVENT_EEMO_2_o1]
Fascinating Intel

[en.EVENT_EEMO_3]
Colorful Manes - Equestria Empire Ministry of Order Report

[en.EVENT_EEMO_3_desc]
As the investigation deepened, the Ministry of Order found some manes in the corner of A.K. Yearling’s former residence. After identification, they contained brown manes, rainbow manes and purple manes, which may come from Yearling, and two members of M6: [CENSORED] and [CENSORED] respectively. This means that before the Ultimate Battle, A.K. Yearling had colluded with M6. There are also many items belonging to Daring Do in the room, and the Ministry of Order cannot yet determine whether Daring Do really exists.

[en.EVENT_EEMO_3_o0]
Strict Suppression!

[en.EVENT_EEMO_3_o1]
Fascinating Intel

[en.EVENT_EEMO_4]
Magic Hat - Equestria Empire Ministry of Order Report

[en.EVENT_EEMO_4_desc]
According to the secret instructions from the Empress Cozy Glow, the loyalty of Duchess Trixie Lulamoon is questionable. Therefore, the Ministry of Order has never given up searching for potential evidence that Trixie is disloyal to the Empire. Evidences indicate that Trixie may still be in contact with the Starlight Rebels, but the means of contact is unknown.
After her appointment as Duchess, Trixie rarely wears her magic hat anymore, but her magic hat is still preserved at home. Although this can be regarded as a symbol that she cannot completely cut off from the past, it is not enough to be substantial evidence. We will continue to investigate.

[en.EVENT_EEMO_4_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_EEMO_4_o1]
Emm...Should I be seeing this?

[en.EVENT_EEMO_4_o2]
Fascinating Intel

[en.EVENT_EEMO_5]
Souvenir Confetti Cannon - Equestria Empire Ministry of Order Report

[en.EVENT_EEMO_5_desc]
Minstry of Order has learned from civilian sources that the souvenir factory in the Rock Farm Autonomous Region is working at full capacity to produce a souvenir confetti cannon belonging to Maud Pie’s sister —— [CENSORED]. The weird matter is that this kind of 1:1 replica souvenir has not been selling well in the local market of the Rock Farm. At first, the Ministry of Order speculated that this was just to meet the governer Maud Pie’s emotional needs, but further investigation showed that most of these souvenirs were sold to the Appleloosa Autonomous Region, and a small part was sold to Sire’s Hollow. Further investigation is needed.

[en.EVENT_EEMO_5_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_EEMO_5_o1]
Fascinating Intel

[en.EVENT_EEMO_6]
Scorch Mark - Equestria Empire Ministry of Order Report

[en.EVENT_EEMO_6_desc]
The Ministry of Order has noticed that one of the shareholders of the Las Pegasus Consortium, Flam, has recently had a scorch mark near his neck, but all the recent reports submitted by Las Pegasus to Ministry of Science and Magic has been about theoretical research. This means that Flim and Flam are likely to be holding secret experimental research. The Ministry of Order urges the Ministry of Science and Magic to immediately launch further investigations, and recommends the subordinated security department to invite the two brothers for accountability talks.

[en.EVENT_EEMO_6_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_EEMO_6_o1]
Fascinating Intel

[en.EVENT_EEMO_7]
A Bundle of Banknotes - Report of the Ministry of Order of the Equestria Empire

[en.EVENT_EEMO_7_desc]
The wealth of Filthy Rich has never surprised anypony, but the recent wealth of Filthy Rich seems to be beyond the past...
A collaborative investigation with the Equestria Empire Ministry of Finance shows that Filthy Rich seems to have unknown funds from multiple sources such as Las Pegasus, Manehattan, and Sire’s Hollow.
However, for unclear reasons, the Minister and Deputy Minister of Finance have privately stated with strong demands that the Ministry of Order should immediately stop the investigation.

[en.EVENT_EEMO_7_o0]
Aha!

[en.EVENT_EEMO_7_o1]
Fascinating Intel

[en.EVENT_EEMO_8]
A Pocket Watch - Report of the Ministry of Order of the Equestria Empire

[en.EVENT_EEMO_8_desc]
Sometimes, Derpy Hooves wears a brass pocket watch, which is quite different from her usual style. The Ministry of Order has tried to investigate the source of the watch in order to find out the non-imperial support behind Duchess Derpy Hooves. But as the investigation deepened, we seemed to have only found some information about Derpy’s... um... private affairs...

[en.EVENT_EEMO_8_o0]
Aha!

[en.EVENT_EEMO_8_o1]
Fascinating Intel

[en.EVENT_EEMO_9]
Female Pony Stealth Suit - Report of the Ministry of Order of the Equestria Empire

[en.EVENT_EEMO_9_desc]
A routine report from the Empire’s Cloudsdale security team states that local theft activities are becoming more rampant, and a large number of muffin shops have been hit by the black hoof. According to the current intelligence and evidence obtained from the scene, we believe... (content erased)... §2that Duchess Derpy attaches great importance to the series of cases, and has personally taken over the investigation of the case. The Ministry of Order and the Empire Central do not need to worry! The report is over! The follow-up progress of the case will no longer be reported!§!

[en.EVENT_EEMO_9_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_EEMO_9_o1]
Duh——

[en.EVENT_EEMO_9_o2]
Fascinating Intel

[en.EVENT_EEMO_10]
Corn Pipe - Report of the Ministry of Order of the Equestria Empire

[en.EVENT_EEMO_10_desc]
The Ministry of Order has just noticed that the Governor of Appleloosa, Braeburn, is smoking a pipe produced in Las Pegasus. Is this a purchase or a gift from another pony? Or is there an unreported trade between Appleloosa and Las Pegasus without the approval of the Ministry of Trade?

[en.EVENT_EEMO_10_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_EEMO_10_o1]
Fascinating Intel

[en.EVENT_EEMO_11]
Grogal’s Bell - Report of the Ministry of Order of the Equestria Empire

[en.EVENT_EEMO_11_desc]
The safety of Grogal’s Bell is always the top priority of the intelligence agencies of all countries. In the past year alone, there have been 12 attempts to steal or seize Grogal’s Bell, 6 of which were committed by unknown perpetrators. Lord Tirek has undoubtedly thwarted every conspiracy. EEMO has reflected on the details and causes of the previous 6 operations and has also considered the other 6 failed operations as a reference. CECIA has evaluated the success rate of Operation <=Watcher=> as: Low.

[en.EVENT_EEMO_11_o0]
Emm...

[en.EVENT_EEMO_11_o1]
Fascinating Intel

[en.EVENT_EEMO_12]
Operation <=Greenlight=> - Report of the Ministry of National Security of the Equestria Empire

[en.EVENT_EEMO_12_desc]
According to the latest situation assessment, the risk of invasion of Ponyville has significantly increased, and the possibility of Ponyville firmly supporting the Empire without surrendering is decreasing. Therefore, it is necessary to take extreme measures to ensure the safety and loyalty of Ponyville.
The ▇▇▇ recently forcibly built by the Empire in Ponyville can be a useful tool - for example, when Ponyville is occupied by rebels or Ponyville itself betrays, detonate them...
(Note: This file should be avoided to be forwarded to Ponyville)

[en.EVENT_EEMO_12_o0]
Good!

[en.EVENT_EEMO_12_o1]
For the love of Celestia, I must inform Trixie

[en.EVENT_EEMO_12_o2]
Emm...

[en.EVENT_EEMO_13]
Operation <=Greenlight=> - Report of the Ministry of National Security of the Equestria Empire

[en.EVENT_EEMO_13_desc]
Through the secret intelligence exchange channel established with Starlight Glimmer, Starlight shared with us a terrifying document from the Empire, the contents of which are as follows:

According to the latest situation assessment, the risk of invasion of Ponyville has significantly increased, and the possibility of Ponyville firmly supporting the Empire without surrendering is decreasing. Therefore, it is necessary to take extreme measures to ensure the safety and loyalty of Ponyville.
The ▇▇▇ recently forcibly built by the Empire in Ponyville can be a useful tool - for example, when Ponyville is occupied by rebels or Ponyville itself betrays, detonate them...
(Note: This file should be avoided to be forwarded to Ponyville)

[en.EVENT_EEMO_13_o0]
???!!!

[en.EVENT_EEMO_13_TOOLTIP]
Unlock a series of decisions: §YOperation <=Redlight=> §!

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_1]
《沉重的狮鹫》——小马利亚帝国秩序部报告

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_1_desc]
据秩序部调查，一本名叫《沉重的狮鹫》的禁书近日开始在市场上流通。这本书是《无畏天马》系列的作者A.K.伊尔琳的新作，由于内容不当在发布后不久就被下架，但依然有不明来源的非法出版社在印刷出版和传播这些书。
秩序部正在深入调查，并开始秘密抓捕在逃作者A.K.伊尔琳。最新证据表明，A.K.伊尔琳正在禁区丛林附近活动。

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_1_o0]
严查！

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_1_o1]
有趣的情报

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_2]
无畏天马的帽子？——小马利亚帝国秩序部报告

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_2_desc]
秩序部在搜查AK·伊尔琳前住处的过程中意外找到了疑似是无畏天马的帽子。这仅仅是cosplay？伪装？还是意味着AK·伊尔琳所撰写的小说都是真实的？那么，她在《沉重的狮鹫》中所描述的平行世界是否也会是真实的？无论真相如何，调查必须在秘密中进行，公众不得知晓。

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_2_o0]
严查！

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_2_o1]
有趣的情报

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_3]
各色鬃毛——小马利亚帝国秩序部报告

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_3_desc]
随着调查深入，秩序部在搜查AK·伊尔琳更早前的住处时，发现了房间角落里的一些鬃毛。经过鉴定，其中包含棕色的鬃毛、彩虹色的鬃毛和紫色的鬃毛，可能分别来自于伊尔琳、战犯M6中的【已和谐】和战犯M6中的【已和谐】。这意味着在终末之战前，AK·伊尔琳与战犯M6有所勾结。房间中还有许多属于无畏天马的物品，秩序部尚不能断定无畏天马是否真实存在。

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_3_o0]
严查！

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_3_o1]
有趣的情报

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_4]
魔术帽——小马利亚帝国秩序部报告

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_4_desc]
根据来自和煦光流女皇的秘密指示，特丽克西·卢拉月领主的忠诚值得怀疑。因此，秩序部从来没有放弃搜寻特丽克西不忠于帝国的潜在证据，有情报显示特丽克西有可能依然与星光叛军保持联系，联系手段未知。
自册封之后，作为领主的特丽克西很少佩戴她的魔术帽，但她的魔术帽依然留在家中。这虽然可以被视作她无法与过去彻底割舍的象征，但并不足以成为实质性的证据。我们将继续深入调查。

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_4_o0]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_4_o1]
额...这是我该看到的吗？

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_4_o2]
有趣的情报

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_5]
纪念礼花炮——小马利亚帝国秩序部报告

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_5_desc]
秩序部通过民间眼线了解到，采石农场自治领的纪念品工厂马力全开，生产属于石灰派的妹妹——【已和谐】的纪念礼花炮。非常奇怪的是，这一1:1还原的纪念品在采石农场地方市场上的销量并不理想。秩序部起初推测这只是为了满足自治区区长石灰派的情感需求，但进一步调查表明，这些纪念品大都被销往苹果鲁萨自治区，还有少部分被销往名流谷。值得进一步调查。

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_5_o0]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_5_o1]
有趣的情报

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_6]
烧痕——小马利亚帝国秩序部报告

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_6_desc]
秩序部注意到，洛马基财团股东之一弗莱姆，最近胸前靠近脖子的地方出现烧痕，但近日洛马基上报帝国科学和魔法部的研究计划报告都为理论研究。这意味着弗立姆和弗莱姆正在向帝国隐瞒一些秘密实验研究。秩序部敦促科学和魔法部立即展开进一步调查，并建议下属安全部们邀请两兄弟进行问责谈话。

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_6_o0]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_6_o1]
有趣的情报

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_7]
一捆钞票——小马利亚帝国秩序部报告

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_7_desc]
钱多多的富有从来不是什么意外，但最近的钱多多似乎超出以往的富有了...
与小马利亚帝国财政部的联合调查表明，钱多多似乎有从洛马基、马哈顿、名流谷等多个来源的不明资金。
但由于未知原因，财政部部长和副部长均私下表态，强烈要求秩序部立即停止调查不明资金。

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_7_o0]
哦豁！

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_7_o1]
有趣的情报

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_8]
一只怀表——小马利亚帝国秩序部报告

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_8_desc]
呆蹄有时会佩戴一只黄铁制的怀表，这与呆蹄日常的风格大相径庭。秩序部试图对怀表的来源进行深入调查，以查明呆蹄领主背后不属于帝国的支持势力。但随着调查的深入，我们似乎只发现了一些关于呆蹄...额...私生活...的情报。

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_8_o0]
哦豁！

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_8_o1]
有趣的情报

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_9]
雌驹体型的潜行外套——小马利亚帝国秩序部报告

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_9_desc]
帝国云中城常驻安保部队例行报告称，地方盗窃活动愈发猖獗，大量马芬商店惨遭黑蹄。根据目前已知的情报和从现场得到的证据，我们认为...（内容被删去）...§2领主呆蹄对系列案件高度重视，已亲自接管案件调查，秩序部和帝国中央无需担忧！报告完毕！相关案件后续进展将不再报告！§!

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_9_o0]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_9_o1]
诶嘿——

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_9_o2]
有趣的情报

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_10]
玉米烟斗——小马利亚帝国秩序部报告

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_10_desc]
秩序部注意到，苹果鲁萨自治区区长布雷本，叼着产自洛马基的烟斗。这仅仅是个马的购买或赠送？还是苹果鲁萨与洛马基之间存在未经上报和帝国贸易部批准的交易行为？

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_10_o0]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_10_o1]
有趣的情报

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_11]
格罗迦之铃——小马利亚帝国秩序部报告

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_11_desc]
格罗迦之铃的安全永远是各国情报部局的首要任务。仅在过去一年就发生了12起试图偷窃或抢夺格罗迦之铃的行为，其中6起作案者不明。提雷克大王毫无悬念地挫败了每一起阴谋。秩序部反思了此前6次行动细节和失败原因，并参考了另外6起的失败原因分析，秩序部评估「观察者」行动的成功率为：低。

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_11_o0]
额...

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_11_o1]
有趣的情报

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_12]
「绿灯」行动——小马利亚帝国国家安全部报告

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_12_desc]
根据最新情况评估，小马谷遭到入侵的风险显著增加，且小马谷坚定支持帝国而不投降的可能性正在降低。因此，有必要采取极端措施，确保小马谷的安全与忠诚。
近日帝国强制在小马谷修建的▇▇▇可以成为一个有利用价值的工具 —— 例如在小马谷被叛军占领或者小马谷自身叛变的时候，引爆它们...
（注：这一文件应该避免转发给小马谷）

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_12_o0]
很好！

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_12_o1]
塞拉斯蒂娅在上，我必须通知特丽克西

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_12_o2]
额...

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_13]
「绿灯」行动——小马利亚帝国国家安全部报告

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_13_desc]
通过与星光熠熠建立的秘密情报交流渠道，星光向我们分享了一份来自帝国的恐怖文件，内容如下：

根据最新情况评估，小马谷遭到入侵的风险显著增加，且小马谷坚定支持帝国而不投降的可能性正在降低。因此，有必要采取极端措施，确保小马谷的安全与忠诚。
近日帝国强制在小马谷修建的▇▇▇可以成为一个有利用价值的工具——例如在小马谷被叛军占领或者小马谷自身叛变的时候，引爆它们...
（注：这一文件应该避免转发给小马谷）

[zh.EVENT_EEMO_13_o0]
？？？！！！

